# cursor-menu-leave (fix-cursor): leaving a theme row for a light/dark cell
# keeps the pointer: the whole menu shows it (claude0's consistency call;
# the reference shows default on both — see decisions.md). Clean Teal row
# centre probed at (1251,226), box [1112,208,278,36]; System cell centre at
# (1159,129), box [1113,112,92,34].
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 1383 48
wait 500
move 1251 226
wait 300
move 1159 129
wait 300
shot cursor-menu-leave
